WEBVTT

00:16.700 --> 00:17.720
Feels great!

00:24.440 --> 00:27.540
Yota, get the phone!

00:27.610 --> 00:30.210
- I will!
- I bet it's you-know-who.

00:30.280 --> 00:33.250
"Moemi Hot Line; 24-7 service!"

00:33.320 --> 00:35.650
Mind your own business!

00:39.390 --> 00:41.380
<i>Moteuchi residence.</i>

00:42.830 --> 00:43.820
Hayakawa here.

00:45.530 --> 00:48.430
<i>Sorry to call so late.</i>

00:48.500 --> 00:51.400
Could I ask you for advice?

00:55.010 --> 00:57.670
A hand-knit scarf, huh?

00:58.310 --> 01:01.370
<i>Hello? Moteuchi, are you there?</i>

01:03.980 --> 01:09.350
It's a good idea. I can't think
of a nicer birthday present.

01:09.420 --> 01:11.720
Takashi'll love it.

01:11.790 --> 01:13.620
<i>I 'm a little embarrassed.</i>

01:13.690 --> 01:15.680
Nothing to be embarrassed about.

01:15.760 --> 01:20.320
It'll be fine.
Give it to him.

01:22.030 --> 01:23.470
Suckerfish!

01:26.840 --> 01:28.360
<i>T-Those wouldn't be--</i>

01:28.440 --> 01:31.470
"Can't think of a nicer present!"

01:38.880 --> 01:41.780
Moteuchi? Hello!? Hello?

01:43.990 --> 01:46.290
I-It was nothin'!

01:48.460 --> 01:50.090
Pathetic.

04:16.340 --> 04:18.100
- One, two!
- One, two!

04:18.180 --> 04:19.730
- One, two!
- One, two!

04:19.810 --> 04:20.970
- One, two!
- One, two!

04:22.950 --> 04:24.440
Moemi?

04:25.650 --> 04:26.980
Moteuchi?

04:28.690 --> 04:31.880
How about it?
You gonna give him his present?

04:37.390 --> 04:40.460
Same as always.
Everybody loves Takashi.

04:41.530 --> 04:44.000
Maybe I'd better quit.

04:44.070 --> 04:45.900
What for?

04:47.570 --> 04:49.370
A knitted scarf--
it's old-fashioned.

04:51.140 --> 04:53.840
But it took a long time
to knit, right?

04:55.750 --> 04:57.240
A month.

04:57.310 --> 04:59.510
All the more reason
to give it to him.

05:01.050 --> 05:02.750
I should have bought something.

05:05.290 --> 05:08.050
- Then let's go buy something!
- Right now?

05:08.130 --> 05:10.720
What's more important,
class or present?

05:25.840 --> 05:27.170
Yahoo!

05:39.220 --> 05:41.710
What'll we do for dinner?

05:42.430 --> 05:45.620
Let's make something
Yota'll really like.

05:48.900 --> 05:52.460
The beautiful Ai makes her man
dinner and awaits his return.

05:52.540 --> 05:55.530
I'm so domestic!

05:59.840 --> 06:00.940
But why?

06:05.520 --> 06:08.540
I'm so glad you're here,
Moteuchi!

06:08.620 --> 06:10.280
Y-You are?

06:10.350 --> 06:15.380
You're Niimai's best friend.

06:15.460 --> 06:19.620
So what do you think
he'd like best?

06:19.700 --> 06:21.790
Is there something wrong?

06:22.600 --> 06:25.730
It's nothing.
Nothing at all.

06:26.600 --> 06:28.400
Moteuchi, wait up!

06:31.310 --> 06:33.300
Hey, officer!

06:33.380 --> 06:35.170
Yeah?

06:36.210 --> 06:40.650
Those kids! Shouldn't they
be in school right now?

06:44.490 --> 06:46.790
Hold it right there!

06:46.860 --> 06:48.520
Oh, no!

06:48.590 --> 06:50.750
What school are you from?

06:52.360 --> 06:54.700
Kandai High School--

06:54.760 --> 06:56.100
Let's go, Moemi!

06:56.170 --> 06:58.430
Hey! Come back here!

07:00.500 --> 07:04.600
Make yer own stupid dinner!

07:05.610 --> 07:09.600
I don't believe it.
I think I'm jealous.

08:17.510 --> 08:20.180
How cute!

08:25.890 --> 08:28.360
<i>I wish I were a teddy bear!</i>

08:28.430 --> 08:33.360
Moteuchi? You think he's cute
too, don't you? See?

08:34.930 --> 08:37.300
Y-Yeah. Sure is.

08:38.340 --> 08:42.270
He is!
So cute!

08:42.340 --> 08:45.670
W-We kissed the same spot.

08:45.740 --> 08:48.040
But it's no good!

08:50.210 --> 08:53.080
Niimai would never like it.

08:53.150 --> 08:57.280
T-Takashi? P-Probably not.

08:59.960 --> 09:01.820
Sure is cute.

09:02.730 --> 09:05.290
<i>Not as cute as you.</i>

09:06.130 --> 09:08.720
Be happy, stupid!

09:08.800 --> 09:12.360
They're getting along, stupid!

09:12.440 --> 09:15.300
Don't be jealous, stupid!

09:15.370 --> 09:18.570
A video girl can't fall in love...

09:18.640 --> 09:20.080
STUPID!

09:29.690 --> 09:33.250
It's you!
What school are YOU from?

09:37.530 --> 09:40.260
- G'bye!
- Stop right there!

09:40.330 --> 09:42.360
- Sorry!
- Stop!

09:47.340 --> 09:50.540
We still didn't find anything.

09:50.610 --> 09:53.630
Just give him the scarf.

09:53.710 --> 09:55.270
But--

09:55.350 --> 09:57.210
Oh, yeah, Moteuchi?

09:58.110 --> 10:01.610
- Did you confess yet?
- Me? Are you kidding?

10:01.690 --> 10:04.550
You should.
You're such a nice guy.

10:04.620 --> 10:07.220
No girl would ever say no to you.

10:07.290 --> 10:09.190
I--

10:09.260 --> 10:11.160
I can't.

10:11.230 --> 10:15.560
Sure you can.
You told me to confess.

10:15.630 --> 10:19.870
Take your own advice
and confess your love!

10:22.670 --> 10:24.970
I have to act natural
when I give him the present.

10:28.340 --> 10:29.440
Wanna practice?

10:30.810 --> 10:31.870
Practice?

10:35.590 --> 10:40.320
"Niimai, I made you a birthday present.
Please take it."

10:45.160 --> 10:49.160
If only I were giving it to you,
it would be so easy.

10:52.900 --> 10:56.400
Now, it's your turn.

10:56.470 --> 10:58.770
Think of me as your true love.

11:01.140 --> 11:03.240
I--I can't.

11:03.310 --> 11:06.770
You sure?
Too bad.

11:06.850 --> 11:10.220
We could make it back
for sixth period.

11:16.760 --> 11:19.420
That cop just wouldn't quit!

11:20.260 --> 11:21.360
Yota.

11:26.600 --> 11:28.440
This is practice--

11:31.210 --> 11:32.970
Hey! Gotta hurry!

11:33.040 --> 11:34.480
It's practice.

11:36.310 --> 11:38.080
You okay, Moteuchi?

11:41.120 --> 11:42.920
I love you!

11:49.830 --> 11:52.460
I love you, Moemi!

12:05.810 --> 12:07.940
Attaboy, Moteuchi!

12:10.480 --> 12:12.240
But one thing's wrong.

12:12.320 --> 12:16.650
You said my name,
not the girl you like.

12:16.720 --> 12:19.950
For a second, I thought
you actually meant me.

12:20.020 --> 12:21.120
Moemi--

12:21.190 --> 12:24.590
That wasn't so tough.

12:27.130 --> 12:31.500
Sixth period's about to start!
Come on!

12:35.510 --> 12:40.970
Yota, guess I'll make dinner
after all.

12:41.610 --> 12:44.010
- Okay, 'bye!
- See you tomorrow!

12:46.350 --> 12:48.680
- Later!
- Hey, dude! Wait up!

12:49.690 --> 12:50.950
- Y'know? Like--
- Ohmigod! Wow!

13:01.700 --> 13:04.030
- "I love you."
- A-Ai!

13:04.100 --> 13:05.690
You didn't--

13:05.770 --> 13:10.040
I-It didn't mean anything!
Just practice, okay?

13:10.110 --> 13:11.370
"Practice"?

13:14.510 --> 13:15.480
Get down!

13:21.780 --> 13:23.910
Moemi, you seen Yota?

13:27.060 --> 13:31.650
That's weird. He told me
to meet him back here.

13:33.130 --> 13:34.290
I--

13:36.430 --> 13:38.560
Moteuchi did it for me.

13:42.170 --> 13:44.940
It's for you.
Happy birthday.

13:49.910 --> 13:55.780
I made a policy not to accept
birthday presents.

13:58.420 --> 14:01.290
I don't accept presents
from anybody.

14:01.360 --> 14:05.850
But take this one!
Please!

14:05.930 --> 14:08.130
You cut classes, right?

14:09.770 --> 14:11.260
Together with Yota.

14:15.270 --> 14:17.600
I hope you make a happy couple.

14:17.670 --> 14:20.580
- That's wrong!
- Wrong? What is?

14:20.640 --> 14:24.810
Moteuchi was only there
to give me advice!

14:24.880 --> 14:27.780
Today, he was just there
to help find a good present.

14:29.050 --> 14:30.210
"Advice"?

14:31.450 --> 14:33.820
What kind of advice do you mean?

14:35.090 --> 14:36.290
You--

14:36.360 --> 14:37.950
You're not--

14:38.030 --> 14:40.000
You're not telling Yota
about your little crushes, are you?

14:40.060 --> 14:42.090
Don't yell at me!

14:48.740 --> 14:53.270
T-That's so cruel!

14:53.340 --> 14:56.440
Because--
I'm in love with you!

15:18.070 --> 15:19.330
Yota--

15:20.500 --> 15:22.500
<i>Yota.</i>

15:22.570 --> 15:23.800
Never mind.

15:24.710 --> 15:28.370
I'm sorry.
Pretend it never happened.

15:28.440 --> 15:30.070
Wait!

15:32.350 --> 15:35.610
Let me think it over.

15:35.690 --> 15:38.050
What does that mean?

15:38.820 --> 15:42.190
If you're going to reject me,
at least do it quickly.

15:42.260 --> 15:45.350
I'll call you tonight.

16:00.240 --> 16:02.510
So, that's that.

16:09.690 --> 16:10.740
Hey.

16:25.570 --> 16:27.870
Catch anything?

16:27.940 --> 16:31.670
Yup. When there's something
to catch.

16:31.740 --> 16:35.440
Sometimes what you fish for
and what you catch are different.

16:36.280 --> 16:37.370
Like this.

16:39.750 --> 16:41.010
See?

16:56.170 --> 16:58.860
- About Moemi--
- Huh?

17:04.470 --> 17:07.030
You're the one
who was angling for her.

17:07.110 --> 17:09.840
Why am I the one
catching the fish?

17:09.910 --> 17:14.150
It's okay.
I knew it would end up this way.

17:14.220 --> 17:17.380
- And you don't mind?
- Mind what?

17:17.450 --> 17:18.550
What do you think?

17:20.060 --> 17:24.190
If it were anybody else,
I'd hate it.

17:24.260 --> 17:27.560
But I can handle it,
as long as it's you.

17:29.400 --> 17:32.430
- I don't get it.
- Don't get me?

17:32.500 --> 17:35.230
You too, but
I don't get me either.

17:36.670 --> 17:40.110
You'll call her tonight
and ask her out.

17:41.480 --> 17:43.610
How'd you know?

17:43.680 --> 17:47.410
When you refuse,
you refuse straight.

17:47.480 --> 17:51.010
But you said
you'd think it over.

17:54.220 --> 17:58.680
Don't change your mind now!
Moemi's serious about this!

17:59.800 --> 18:03.390
Come on, Takashi!
Go out with her!

18:03.470 --> 18:05.700
Moemi's a great girl!

18:06.940 --> 18:11.170
Ai! Let's go!

18:13.180 --> 18:16.150
Good luck, Mister.

18:17.710 --> 18:19.110
You finished your big talk?

18:19.180 --> 18:22.050
Yeah. What's in your hand?

18:27.160 --> 18:28.890
A present for you!

18:28.960 --> 18:30.790
Yota, homeward bound!

18:30.860 --> 18:33.690
- See 'ya, Takashi!
- Quit it, Ai!

18:33.760 --> 18:34.790
C'mon! C'mon!

18:34.860 --> 18:36.160
I'm coming already!

18:36.230 --> 18:37.830
Takashi, I'll phone you!

18:37.900 --> 18:40.800
- Can we go already?
- Hold it!

19:06.700 --> 19:10.660
I can't stand it!
My heart's gonna burst!

19:15.940 --> 19:18.370
Hey, Yota!

19:21.110 --> 19:22.240
Yota?

19:22.850 --> 19:23.870
Yeah?

19:25.480 --> 19:28.850
You aren't depressed
or anything, are you?

19:31.690 --> 19:34.090
- Yota!
- Whaddaya want?

19:36.330 --> 19:41.160
- Nothin'.
- I get it. You make me so happy.

19:41.230 --> 19:45.190
You're so wrapped up in me,
you can't think of anything else.

19:47.340 --> 19:48.860
You wish!

19:57.810 --> 20:02.220
Dammit! See if I
worry about him again!

20:06.560 --> 20:07.550
Hello.

20:07.620 --> 20:09.290
<i>Hello, Moteuchi?</i>

20:11.490 --> 20:12.760
Moemi--

20:26.680 --> 20:29.870
<i>I 'm sorry to call so late.</i>

20:29.950 --> 20:34.540
<i>Niimai said he'd</i>
<i>call me tonight, but...</i>

20:34.620 --> 20:37.180
<i>I just can't stand waiting.</i>

20:37.250 --> 20:39.690
<i>Hello? Are you there?</i>

20:39.760 --> 20:41.820
<i>Moteuchi!</i>

21:07.280 --> 21:09.340
Who is it?

21:18.090 --> 21:19.690
That's strange.

21:25.430 --> 21:26.400
Who's there?

21:30.440 --> 21:33.200
Niimai!

21:33.280 --> 21:34.330
Why?

21:45.320 --> 21:46.810
Here.

22:12.110 --> 22:16.210
Yota, I heard the phone.

22:21.060 --> 22:22.790
I should have known.

22:23.660 --> 22:27.820
Moemi's just like that old boot.

22:27.900 --> 22:29.460
That old boot?

22:29.530 --> 22:33.030
She shoulda been happy
to be caught by you.

22:33.100 --> 22:35.770
But she had to try
to snag Takashi's line.

22:36.510 --> 22:38.770
Just an old boot.

22:40.540 --> 22:42.740
"Once upon a time
in a land far away..."

22:44.880 --> 22:49.720
"there was a fisherman
who used old boots as his bait."

22:50.990 --> 22:55.720
"He caught many types
of fish in his old boot."

22:55.790 --> 22:59.250
"There was one fish
he couldn't catch."

22:59.330 --> 23:02.560
Know which kind
of fish that was?

23:02.630 --> 23:04.830
I dunno.

23:04.900 --> 23:07.700
- His angel fish.
- "His angel fish."

23:07.770 --> 23:12.610
- "Can't catch an angel."
- Yota.

23:20.480 --> 23:21.450
Yota.

23:24.920 --> 23:27.220
"Suckerfish!"

23:28.120 --> 23:30.890
Hey, say something.

23:31.690 --> 23:33.960
Guess you don't feel like it.

23:51.950 --> 23:54.970
<i>Cry as much as you like, Yota.</i>

23:55.050 --> 23:57.040
<i>As long as you want.</i>

23:57.120 --> 24:00.780
<i>You did your best today.</i>

24:00.860 --> 24:06.590
<i>I 'm a video girl.</i>
<i>I'll try my best to cheer you up.</i>

24:06.660 --> 24:09.060
<i>For as long as time will let me.</i>

24:15.870 --> 24:17.900
<i>That's right.</i>

24:17.970 --> 24:20.740
<i>For as long as time will let me.</i>

26:41.950 --> 26:42.880
Yota.

26:45.390 --> 26:50.290
Yota, if you don't like it,
try to take Moemi from me.

26:50.360 --> 26:53.850
I could never do
anything like that!

26:58.030 --> 27:02.160
When we're together, why do you
only talk about Yota?

27:02.240 --> 27:05.800
Are you sure it's not him
that you love?

27:10.750 --> 27:11.980
Ai!

27:14.220 --> 27:15.740
Where are you, Ai?

27:18.490 --> 27:20.420
Yota!

27:24.090 --> 27:25.890
But that's not true!

27:26.560 --> 27:30.020
Yota Moteuchi has come
to need Ai.

27:30.100 --> 27:32.400
Where did you go?

27:32.470 --> 27:36.430
<i>Ai!</i>
